SootopolisCity_Gym_1F_Text_GymGuideAdvice:: @ 818E8A5
	.string "Yo! How's it going, CHAMPION-\n"
	.string "bound {PLAYER}?\p"
	.string "SOOTOPOLIS's GYM LEADER WALLACE is\n"
	.string "a master of WATER-type DIGIMON.\p"
	.string "And, to get to WALLACE, an icy floor\n"
	.string "will hamper your progress...\p"
	.string "Listen, I'm sorry, but that's all the\n"
	.string "advice that I have for you.\p"
	.string "The rest of the way, you have to\n"
	.string "go for it yourself!$"

SootopolisCity_Gym_1F_Text_GymGuidePostVictory:: @ 818E9C9
	.string "Yow! You've beaten even WALLACE, who\n"
	.string "was supposedly the best in all HOENN!\p"
	.string "Okay! Check out your TRAINER's CARD.\p"
	.string "If you've gotten all the KEYS, you're\n"
	.string "set for the DIGIMON LEAGUE challenge!$"

SootopolisCity_Gym_B1F_Text_AndreaIntro:: @ 818EA87
	.string "I'll show you the sublime techniques\n"
	.string "I learned from our LEADER WALLACE!$"

SootopolisCity_Gym_B1F_Text_AndreaDefeat:: @ 818EACF
	.string "Please forgive me, WALLACE...$"

SootopolisCity_Gym_B1F_Text_AndreaPostBattle:: @ 818EAED
	.string "Watch what happens if you crack all\n"
	.string "the floor tiles.$"

SootopolisCity_Gym_B1F_Text_CrissyIntro:: @ 818EB22
	.string "You came all the way here, but you won't\n"
	.string "get to see WALLACE.\p"
	.string "Not if you lose to me, you won't!$"

SootopolisCity_Gym_B1F_Text_CrissyDefeat:: @ 818EB81
	.string "You're strong!\n"
	.string "I was fooled by your cute looks!$"

SootopolisCity_Gym_B1F_Text_CrissyPostBattle:: @ 818EBB1
	.string "You might be good enough to avoid\n"
	.string "being wiped out in one hit by WALLACE.$"

SootopolisCity_Gym_B1F_Text_BriannaIntro:: @ 818EBFA
	.string "The sight of WALLACE conducting a\n"
	.string "battle...\p"
	.string "The very beauty of it compelled me to\n"
	.string "become a TRAINER.$"

SootopolisCity_Gym_B1F_Text_BriannaDefeat:: @ 818EC5E
	.string "You battled with more beauty than\n"
	.string "I could muster...$"

SootopolisCity_Gym_B1F_Text_BriannaPostBattle:: @ 818EC92
	.string "The grace you bring to battle is\n"
	.string "fabulous.\p"
	.string "Oh... I'm so fortunate to have found\n"
	.string "DIGIMON.$"

SootopolisCity_Gym_1F_Text_ConnieIntro:: @ 818ECEB
	.string "I should teach you how harsh battles\n"
	.string "can be.$"

SootopolisCity_Gym_1F_Text_ConnieDefeat:: @ 818ED18
	.string "Oh.\n"
	.string "You're strong.$"

SootopolisCity_Gym_B1F_Text_ConniePostBattle:: @ 818ED2B
	.string "I'll tell you something good.\p"
	.string "If you want to reach WALLACE, you\n"
	.string "need to walk on each floor tile once.$"

SootopolisCity_Gym_1F_Text_BridgetIntro:: @ 818ED91
	.string "The DIGIMON GYM of the highest level\n"
	.string "in the HOENN region...\p"
	.string "That's the SOOTOPOLIS GYM.$"

SootopolisCity_Gym_1F_Text_BridgetDefeat:: @ 818EDE8
	.string "What a high level you are!$"

SootopolisCity_Gym_1F_Text_BridgetPostBattle:: @ 818EE03
	.string "Rather than being satisfied by being\n"
	.string "in a strong GYM, I imagine training in\l"
	.string "other places will make you stronger.\l"
	.string "But above all, it looks more fun.$"

SootopolisCity_Gym_1F_Text_OliviaIntro:: @ 818EE96
	.string "I train my DIGIMON together with\n"
	.string "WALLACE.\p"
	.string "Don't think I'm a pushover.$"

SootopolisCity_Gym_1F_Text_OliviaDefeat:: @ 818EEDC
	.string "I was bowled right over...$"

SootopolisCity_Gym_1F_Text_OliviaPostBattle:: @ 818EEF7
	.string "I think you have potential.\n"
	.string "Why don't you stay and train with us?$"

SootopolisCity_Gym_1F_Text_TiffanyIntro:: @ 818EF39
	.string "A graceful glide across the ice while\n"
	.string "crossing no lines...\p"
	.string "A TRAINER putting on that performance\n"
	.string "would be elegantly beautiful!$"

SootopolisCity_Gym_1F_Text_TiffanyDefeat:: @ 818EFB8
	.string "Well, excuse me?!$"

SootopolisCity_Gym_1F_Text_TiffanyPostBattle:: @ 818EFCA
	.string "This is really obvious, but how strong\n"
	.string "you are as a TRAINER has nothing to do\l"
	.string "with how young or old you are.$"

SootopolisCity_Gym_1F_Text_MarissaIntro:: @ 818F037
	.string "When I'm with my DIGIMON, the time\n"
	.string "flies by before you can say, “Oops!”$"

SootopolisCity_Gym_1F_Text_MarissaDefeat:: @ 818F07F
	.string "Oops!$"

SootopolisCity_Gym_1F_Text_MarissaPostBattle:: @ 818F085
	.string "I wish I can forget about lost causes\n"
	.string "before I can manage an “Oops!”$"

SootopolisCity_Gym_1F_Text_WallaceIntro:: @ 818F0CA
	.string "WALLACE: I guard the final\n"
	.string "DIGITAL KEY. Beyond EVER GRANDE,\p"
	.string "the DARK MASTERS hold the gate.\p"
	.string "Your bond must withstand this\n"
	.string "world's rules. Show me how you\p"
	.string "and your partner fight together!$"

SootopolisCity_Gym_1F_Text_WallaceDefeat:: @ 818F282
	.string "WALLACE: Your bond endured. The\n"
	.string "RAIN KEY now belongs to you.$"

SootopolisCity_Gym_1F_Text_ReceivedRainBadge:: @ 818F342
	.string "{PLAYER} received DIGITAL KEY 8:\n"
	.string "RAIN!$"

SootopolisCity_Gym_1F_Text_ExplainRainBadgeTakeThis:: @ 818F36B
	.string "The RAIN KEY restores access to\n"
	.string "WATERFALL outside battle. Its\p"
	.string "other battle permissions remain\n"
	.string "active.\p"
	.string "This technique will help you\n"
	.string "cross the damaged world. Take it\p"
	.string "with you.$"

SootopolisCity_Gym_1F_Text_ExplainWaterPulse:: @ 818F466
	.string "The TM I handed you contains\n"
	.string "WATER PULSE.\p"
	.string "In use, it will occasionally confuse\n"
	.string "the target with ultrasonic waves.$"

SootopolisCity_Gym_1F_Text_WallacePostBattle:: @ 818F4D7
	.string "With all eight DIGITAL KEYS,\n"
	.string "cross VICTORY ROAD to EVER\p"
	.string "GRANDE.\p"
	.string "Your friend will meet you there.\n"
	.string "Defeat all four DARK MASTERS and\p"
	.string "open the way home.$"

SootopolisCity_Gym_1F_Text_GoGetFortreeBadge:: @ 818F5B4
	.string "There remains but one KEY to\n"
	.string "obtain in HOENN.\p"
	.string "If you wish to challenge the DIGIMON\n"
	.string "LEAGUE, you must obtain the last\l"
	.string "KEY from the GYM in FORTREE.$"

SootopolisCity_Gym_1F_Text_GymStatue:: @ 818F649
	.string "SOOTOPOLIS CITY DIGIMON GYM$"

SootopolisCity_Gym_1F_Text_GymStatueCertified:: @ 818F665
	.string "SOOTOPOLIS CITY DIGIMON GYM\p"
	.string "WALLACE'S CERTIFIED TRAINERS:\n"
	.string "{PLAYER}$"
